--------------------------------

### PUT [presignedUrl]

Source: https://vercel.com/docs/vercel-blob/vercel-signed-urls

Uploads a blob to the specified pathname. Enforces constraints configured during the presigning process.

```APIDOC
## PUT [presignedUrl]

### Description
Uploads file data to Vercel Blob storage.

### Method
PUT

### Endpoint
[presignedUrl]

### Parameters
#### Request Body
- **body** (binary) - The raw bytes of the file to upload.

#### Request Headers
- **content-type** (string) - Required. Must match the `allowedContentTypes` if specified during presigning.
```

